<view class="snack-page profile-page">
  <view class="page-lead">
    <view class="small-kicker">MY NEIGHBOURHOOD / 我的社区</view>
    <view class="page-title">住得近一点，<view>生活轻松一点<text class="title-period">.</text></view></view>
    <view class="page-sub">商品信息与配送说明</view>
  </view>

  <view class="profile-hero">
    <view class="profile-avatar"><text>里</text></view>
    <view class="profile-hero-copy">
      <view class="profile-hero-title">爱尚里生活</view>
      <view class="profile-hero-sub">家门口的小事，一起办好</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 完整功能引导到网站 -->
  <view class="profile-section">
    <view class="compliance-banner">
      本小程序仅提供信息展示。下单、需求登记、邻里广场、闲置分享、跑腿代取等功能，请在浏览器中访问网站使用。
    </view>
    <view aria-role="button" class="publish-button" bindtap="copyWebsite" aria-label="复制网站地址">
      <image src="/images/community/package-open.svg"/>
      <text>复制网站地址 · {{website}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="profile-section">
    <view class="profile-section-heading">配送服务</view>
    <view class="profile-row">
      <view><view class="profile-row-title">保利爱尚里上门配送</view><view class="profile-row-sub">仅限小区 16、17、18 栋</view></view>
      <text>送到门口</text>
    </view>
    <view class="profile-row">
      <view><view class="profile-row-title">送达方式自选</view><view class="profile-row-sub">登记时选择敲门或到达后电话联系</view></view>
      <text>按需选择</text>
    </view>
    <view class="profile-row">
      <view><view class="profile-row-title">营业与配送</view><view class="profile-row-sub">{{hours}}</view></view>
      <text>{{isOpen ? '接单中' : '休息中'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="profile-row">
      <view><view class="profile-row-title">配送规则</view><view class="profile-row-sub">商品满 ¥{{minOrder}} 起送 · 配送费 ¥{{deliveryFee}}</view></view>
      <text>线下结算</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="compliance-note">
    <view class="compliance-title">温馨提示</view>
    <view>本小程序仅提供社区便民信息展示，不提供在线下单、在线支付与交易担保。实际商品、费用与送达以店家线下与您确认为准。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="profile-footer">保利爱尚里 · 爱尚里生活</view>
</view>
